  backlog-value-scan: re-read every gated entry under the
    enabling-value rule (preamble above, b73ad81): per item, ask
    what it might enable and whether its gate still rests on a
    considered failure to think of value rather than the old
    no-consumer-today reading. Folds into the model-space research
    VD wants before any multiforest update shape (the research gate
    in runsbcbcf-repair.md "setData door survey"); VD-timed, in due
    course.
  bcf-sigma-tail-mixing: OPTIONAL research door (docs/plans/bcf-sigma-
    residual.md sec 4 item 2; no separate plan doc). The BCF sigma SBC
    flag was diagnosed as a slow forest-mixing burn transient and fixed
    for acceptance by pinning absolute burn sweeps (no engine or
    draw-law change). Open: the EXTREME tail (|a0| >= ~40, ~3% of the
    prior) is frozen-structure mixing that no amount of burn fixes; a
    principled remedy would target tree-structure mixing at high SNR
    (tempered early sweeps, restart-style grow proposals). Low priority
    - the regime only arises with a stale build scale swapped against a
    new response inside a larger Gibbs loop (setResponse
    updateScale=FALSE). research-open, decision-gated.
  blocked-jacobi-trees: RESEARCHED, KILLED 2026-07-21 (df13c04 +
    77597cc) - full record, lesson, and reopen clause in
    docs/plans/blocked-jacobi-trees.md and
    docs/design/within-chain-threading.md.
  correlated-outcomes: richer error/outcome covariance around a BART
    mean, delivered via outer-sampler composition (stan4bart = WALNUTS
    + dbarts supplying each outcome's conditional mean; the pattern
    bairrtt uses). RESOLVED 2026-07-22 (docs/design/correlated-
    outcomes.md): (b) multivariate / multiple correlated outcomes
    SHIPPED as mvbart() in stan4bart (e27a7c3) with zero dbarts code -
    SUR chained conditionals reduce each outcome's step to a
    per-observation offset + scalar sd against resid.prior=fixed()
    (mediation is the triangular case, rho the sensitivity knob). What
    remains open: (a) AR-1 / serially-correlated errors (longitudinal,
    panel, ITS, DiD - the Bertrand-Duflo-Mullainathan SE problem)
    compose today via a latent AR-state + nugget in the outer sampler
    (the rbart_vi pattern, AR replacing the intercept), with EXACT
    pure-AR-1 errors a deferred ENGINE door (banded residual precision
    + cross-leaf GLS leaf updates break per-leaf independence).
    Exposing the per-sweep callback on dbartsSampler$run is a perf-only
    convenience, not a gate (demoted in the design doc).
    causal-motivated, decision-gated.
