    locality reordering measured DEAD, data-layout.md re-evaluated and
    closed shelved. The fused-kernel falsifier RAN 2026-08-07
    (memory-wall-frontier.md sec 11): K=4 accumulator-banked fusion
    GREEN in situ on Zen2 - 1.41-1.43x at n=1e5, 1.49-1.54x at
    n=1e6, the no-signal worst case a 1.11x win - while K=1 is NOT
    green (privatization is the mechanism; K joins the exactness
    contract, and draws shift last-ULP, so baselines re-record at
    landing). The fused-suffstat arc LANDED c8f661a 2026-08-07 (full
    record memory-wall-frontier.md secs 11-13): the constant-leaf
    fp64 unweighted fresh-leafOf path takes the fused four-bank pass
